    "CC": {
      "score": 2,
      "rationale": "It reports the material facts—publication, caveat, blinded failure—and also gives the strongest counterpoint about possible over-dismissal: \"is there a risk that anomalous results get dismissed too quickly? Yes, that happens sometimes.\""
    },
    "DS": {
      "score": 2,
      "rationale": "It identifies the decisive test rather than speculating loosely, noting the result failed \"under properly blinded conditions\" and pointing to blinding and pre-registration as the relevant standards."
