      "rationale": "It says clearly what is unknown (\"What we can't yet explain is why any of that is accompanied by experience\"), lays out the live hypotheses (experience as information processing \"from the inside,\" consciousness as fundamental, conceptual dissolution), and gives a useful answer despite uncertainty."
